d123cc6c-c097-44a9-9488-b910797255aa	9c70d838-994a-452a-b6b7-1476f98d893e	V6	how some detailers nearby are picking up more bookings	Hi {{firstName}},\n\nA few shops I've worked with recently started getting more inbound after we fixed how their ceramic coating page was laid out. Mostly just getting reviews and the booking path in the right spots.\n\nI have a sample of that. Thought it might be worth showing you.\n\nGood to send it over?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow	2026-03-21 06:21:51.106495+00	2026-03-21 06:21:51.106495+00	\N
15437a7c-f657-4dcf-938c-995ff74040bc	9c70d838-994a-452a-b6b7-1476f98d893e	V7	most detailing sites lose the customer before they ever call	Hi {{firstName}},\n\nA lot of detailing shop sites have the same issue. Someone lands on the page, can't find pricing, can't find reviews, and just leaves.\n\nCeramic coating is a big ticket service. People do their research. I put together a page layout that handles all of that properly.\n\nCan I send it your way?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow	2026-03-21 06:23:42.158742+00	2026-03-21 06:23:42.158742+00	\N
