780808ec-3794-46ec-8b3e-016399624360	9c70d838-994a-452a-b6b7-1476f98d893e	V10	can I show you something for your shop, {{firstName}}?	Hey {{firstName}},\n\nNot going to pitch you on anything today. Just want to show you a page layout I put together for a ceramic coating service and see if it makes sense for your shop.\n\nIf it's a fit, great. If not, no worries.\n\nWorth a look?\n\nBest, \nDemGrow	2026-03-21 06:29:06.72213+00	2026-03-21 06:29:06.72213+00	\N
